content.clarity,_quality,_novelty_and_reproducib:
The paper is organized and written well. However, there are some issues in the current version which need to be significantly improved. 

Clarity: The experimental comparisons (eg.., FSOD and gFSOD) and some details (e.g., the number of additional training images) are not clear;

Novelty: The novelty is limited because the proposed method is an incremental improvement by incorporating the pseudo-label few-shot object detection and teacher-student semi-supervised object detection;

Reproducibility: The proposed method involved many hyper-parameters and training stages and thus there are some difficulties in reproducibility.
